  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The product contains all the non-3D printed parts for assembling an entirely functional Kinetic Manta Ray - Biomimetic Automata. To complete the work, you also need to download the model files and 3D print the remaining parts."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Creator Program: The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "To download the model files please visit the Kinetic Manta Ray - Biomimetic Automata on MakerWorld."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Two Ways to Bring It to Life"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "01 / LEFT Battery Edition 02 / RIGHT USB Edition"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "01 / LEFT Battery Edition"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "02 / RIGHT USB Edition"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Battery Edition"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Note: This model requires the 150rpm N20 motor (LA002) listed above. The 500rpm N20 motor included in the Rechargeable Power Kit is not suitable for this model."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "USB Edition"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "All required cables are included. IA005 includes a USB-A power cable, a PH2.0 cable pair, and SH1.0 jumper wires; LA002 includes an SH1.0 cable pair; IA006 and IA007 each include an SH1.0 cable pair. Components are included according to the edition lists above."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 24px; text-align: center;\">Overview</h2>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">The product contains all the <strong>non-3D printed</strong> parts for assembling an entirely functional <strong>Kinetic Manta Ray - Biomimetic Automata</strong>. To complete the work, you also need to download the <strong>model files</strong> and <strong>3D print</strong> the remaining parts.<span></span></p>\n<!--Overview部分（无需改动）-->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><em><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">Creator Program</span><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">:</span></em></strong></span><strong><em> </em></strong>The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs.</div>\n<!--创作者计划注释（无需改动）-->\n<p></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<p class=\"pct_p\">To download the model files please visit the <strong>Kinetic Manta Ray - Biomimetic Automata</strong> on <a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/2392366-kinetic-manta-ray-biomimetic-automata?from=search#profileId-2621104\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">MakerWorld</span></strong></span></a>.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_ic\">\n<div class=\"edition-showcase\">\n<div class=\"edition-showcase__header\"><span class=\"edition-showcase__eyebrow\">Choose Your Edition</span>\n<h2 class=\"edition-showcase__title\">Two Ways to Bring It to Life</h2>\n</div>\n<img alt=\"Battery Edition on the left and USB Edition on the right\" class=\"edition-showcase__image product-